<title>UK: Banco Bansud sets $75 mln three-year bond.</title>
<headline>Banco Bansud sets $75 mln three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ABN AMRO Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANCO BANSUD</p>
<p> AMT    $75 MLN	 COUPON     **	  MATURITY    13.DEC.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    13.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.875     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD    +355-375 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	** TO BE PRICED LATER.</p>
<p> MOODY	B1	  LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK/AR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  ARGENTINA TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  0.50	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND NOVEMBER 1999 U.S. TREASURY.</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSSUED OFF ISSUERS $300MLN MTN PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
